<title>USA: Snap-On Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Snap-On Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>KENOSHA, Wis. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.56		  $  0.49</p>
<p> Net			 33,854		   29,650</p>
<p> Sales		    375,299		  344,364</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,855		   60,921</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 gains due to improved sales in all three of the company's geographic segments, and significant contributions from acquisitions. Total operating expenses as a percent of sales fell to 40.3 percent vs 40.6 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
